        "type": "nodetool.workflows.base_node.Comment",
        "data": {
          "comment": "# Restyle a Photo as an Illustration\n\nTurns a photo into a flat vector illustration while keeping its composition. Use it to make matching artwork from existing photography.\n\n**How it works:** \"Photo\" takes your image. \"Restyle\" runs image-to-image with a prompt for bold shapes and a limited palette at a strength of 0.65, and \"Result\" shows the illustration.\n\n**Try this:** Pick a model on \"Restyle\", then move strength down to 0.4 to keep more of the photo, or up to 0.85 to redraw it more freely."
        },
